	(text_box "We use a USB-C port to charge our battery. For this port to work with the BQ25886, it needs to be a USB2.0 port. We only need the information of the current and the voltage that is being used.\n "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.18 184.15 0)
		(size 45.72 12.7)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0bf8adfd-4699-4a73-831b-0160dd12314f")
	)
	(text_box "These are the connections from the battery to the board. The battery comes with two connectors; one for power and one for balancing. The power cables have an external connector to the board and are then brought on the board. The balancing JST-XH connector has its counterpart soldered on the board so the connection is made directly on the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.29 31.5486 0)
		(size 64.77 14.1714)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
